    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6663f85a41f1a28a2cdc552d/E4I2MTLJZcJItn0G_kmx3.png) ⟨28⟩\nWTForbes⟨28⟩\n/\nhak⟨29⟩\nlike 1\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨30⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨31⟩ Community ⟨32⟩\n##  You need to agree to share your contact information to access this dataset\nThis repository is publicly accessible, but you have to accept the conditions to access its files and content.\nLog in⟨33⟩ or Sign Up⟨34⟩ to review the conditions and access this dataset content.\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨35⟩ for more information.\n  * Status⟨36⟩\n  * Layout⟨37⟩\n  * Rules⟨38⟩\n  * Subsets⟨39⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨40⟩ WTForbes/hak \nConsolidated `hak` dataset repo staged from referenced corpus JSONL rows only.\n##   ⟨36⟩ Status \n  * corpus_jsonl: staged\n  * root_corpus_jsonl: completed\n  * subset_corpus_jsonl: completed\n  * manifests: staged\n  * manifests_upload: completed\n  * audio_parquet: completed\n  * upload: completed\n  * upload_policy: referenced audio only; never upload whole source directories\n\n\n##   ⟨37⟩ Layout \n\n```\ncorpus_dir_jsonl/{train,train_stage1,eval}.jsonl\nsubsets/<subset>/\n  corpus_dir_jsonl/{train,train_stage1,eval}.jsonl\n  manifests/audio_manifest.tsv\n  audio_parquet/part-xxxxx.parquet\n\n```\n\n`corpus_dir_jsonl/` contains the full un-split corpus for `hak`. `subsets/` keeps the source-set grouping used for selected corpus files, manifests, and audio parquet shards.\n##   ⟨38⟩ Rules \n  * Preserve `original_audio_filepath` in every corpus row.\n  * Rewrite `audio_filepath` to `subsets/<subset>/audio/<source_set>/<sha shard>/<audio_id>.<stored_ext>`.\n  * Convert WAV to FLAC before writing Parquet.\n  * Keep existing FLAC/MP3/Opus/Ogg codecs unless explicitly changed later.\n  * Use deterministic `audio_id` and SHA shard paths to avoid basename collisions.\n\n\n##   ⟨39⟩ Subsets \n  * `hak_yijiazhizhu` from `hak_hak__yijiazhizhu`\n  * `hakka_processed_2023_year_hakka_collection` from `hak_hakka_processed__2023_year_hakka_collection`\n  * `hakka_processed_2024_year_hakka_collection` from `hak_hakka_processed__2024_year_hakka_collection`\n  * `hakka_processed_2025_year_hakka_collection` from `hak_hakka_processed__2025_year_hakka_collection`\n  * `hakka_processed_2026_year_hakka_collection` from `hak_hakka_processed__2026_year_hakka_collection`\n  * `hakka_processed_audio_fixed_25146` from `hak_hakka_processed__audio_fixed_25146`\n  * `hakka_processed_eattogther` from `hak_hakka_processed__eattogther`\n  * `hakka_processed_show_hou` from `hak_hakka_processed__show_hou`\n  * `hakka_processed_singing` from `hak_hakka_processed__singing`\n  * `hakka_processed_whotoeat` from `hak_hakka_processed__whotoeat`\n\n\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    18\nTotal file size: 80.1 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨41⟩ Privacy⟨42⟩ About⟨43⟩ Careers⟨44⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
